Package: nightowl
Title: Declarative Plots and Summary Tables with Inline Graphics for Clinical Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Joel",
           family = "Gsponer",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jgsponer@gmail.com")
Description: A small grammar for publication-ready statistical graphics built on
    'ggplot2'. Plots are declared as layer stacks, optionally from 'YAML' style
    files, and rendered to 'SVG' with memoised rendering. Plots are first-class
    vector elements, so a column of a data frame can hold sparklines that render
    inside 'reactable' and 'kableExtra' tables. Includes an extensible summary
    table engine, colour-blind-safe palettes, a house theme, and helpers for
    snapshot-testing 'SVG' output.
